L1: Effect of milk fat globule membrane supplementation on motor unit adaptation following resistance training in older adults
L2: Physiological Reports (2020)
L3: Kohei Watanabe, Aleš Holobar, Aya Tomita, Yukiko Mita
L4: 1 
L5:  Laboratory of Neuromuscular Biomechanics 
L6:  School of International Liberal Studies 
L7:  Chukyo University 
